stateDiagram-v2
    state publish_check <<choice>>

    [*] --> draft: drafter saves a new draft<br/>(changes composed in browser,<br/>records base_rev)
    draft --> draft: any drafter updates the draft<br/>(replaces changes, notes, base_rev)
    draft --> discarded: any drafter discards
    draft --> publish_check: approver publishes<br/>(checks re-run)
    publish_check --> draft: blocked by a conflict with a newer revision<br/>or structural error → drafter updates
    publish_check --> published: checks pass<br/>(atomic → TREE_REVISION r+1)
    published --> [*]
    discarded --> [*]

    note left of published
        publish is blocked only by structural errors:
        cycle, target or parent not in the tree,
        foreign parent, deprecate with children,
        non-machine-safe label, or a touched node
        changed or deprecated since base_rev.
        WoRMS issues are warnings.
        Published changesets can't be edited.
    end note
